{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the final living tree on a desolate Earth, it is your mission to recolonize and revitalize the dying planet. Plant saplings and explore the world while protecting your forest from invading bugs!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your Forest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692400/extras/a0e0c196bb45a5cb83cdfa2395d66fa3.poster.avif?t=1768716743\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692400/extras/a0e0c196bb45a5cb83cdfa2395d66fa3.webm?t=1768716743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692400/extras/a0e0c196bb45a5cb83cdfa2395d66fa3.mp4?t=1768716743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Grow your forest by planting new trees, but make sure to maintain a fine balance of your resources! A hydrated forest is a happy forest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fend off Parasitic Bugs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692400/extras/c5105f9f7d915ed45cd8932786b49ae9.poster.avif?t=1768716743\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692400/extras/c5105f9f7d915ed45cd8932786b49ae9.webm?t=1768716743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692400/extras/c5105f9f7d915ed45cd8932786b49ae9.mp4?t=1768716743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>As your forest grows larger, it will attract the attention of giant mutant insects looking for fresh food. Prepare your defenses with a variety of trees and fend off the incoming invasions!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Unique New Trees</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692400/extras/f16aa0923d92aea04ffcadd98f0531bd.poster.avif?t=1768716743\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692400/extras/f16aa0923d92aea04ffcadd98f0531bd.webm?t=1768716743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692400/extras/f16aa0923d92aea04ffcadd98f0531bd.mp4?t=1768716743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>While exploring the world, you may discover traces of ancient tree colonies. Revitalize these petrified trees and utilize their abilities to defend and expand your forest!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692400?t=1768716743","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692400?t=1768716743","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692400/d5b410cdf19a222231b23da974fdd8e0bb167ffa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768716743","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692400/d5b410cdf19a222231b23da974fdd8e0bb167ffa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768716743","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the final living tree on a desolate Earth, it is your mission to recolonize and revitalize the d